    "https://www.pointpark.edu/careerready/index": {
      "title": "Career-Focused Programs, Dynamic Downtown Campus",
      "description": "Career-Focused Programs, Dynamic Downtown Campus | Point Park University Skip to main content Menu Menu In this section In this section Apply Request Info About Us Academics Admissions & Financial Aid Career-ready Student Life Give Now Apply Request Info Events Calendar A-Z Quicklinks My Point Park Contact Us Career-Ready Alumni Career Profiles Career Center Co-op Student Profiles Get Career-Ready Student Internship Profiles Menu Menu Apply Now Request Info Â« Point Park University Search Search Career-Focused Programs, Dynamic Downtown Campus Point Park University is where it all comes together. Our career-focused programs converge with a dynamic Downtown Pittsburgh campus to prepare you for work and life. Co-op, internship and career opportunities are right at your doorstep. Additionally, our Professional Career-Readiness Center is always ready to help you — both before and after you graduate — with internship and job searches, resumes, cover letters and interviewing skills. From Classroom to Career â That's the Point! Alumni Profiles Whether they’re performing on Broadway or working at one of the Big Four accounting firms, Point Park grads credit their education with setting them up for real-world success. Alumni career profiles Internship Profiles Internships provide students with hands-on experience, practical skills and a sense of what the workplace is actually like. Internship profiles Co-op Programs With connections to companies throughout Pittsburgh and beyond, students are immersed in the real world through full-time, paid work experience, enhancing their career opportunities before they graduate. Co-op programs Professional Career-Readiness Center The PCRC helps students get career‑ready by exploring career paths and gaining hands‑on experience, such as internships and co‑ops. Create a path to your success Point Park University 201 Wood Street Pittsburgh, PA 15222-1984 Careers at Point Park Location & Directions Non-discrimination Policy Privacy Policy Ready to learn more? Request information Plan a visit Take a virtual tour Calculate financial aid Follow Us tiktok instagram facebook Linkedin Â youtube Â Apply Now"
