ment Hosts Pittsburgh Police Recognition Ceremony on Campus Tuesday, December 18, 2018 More than 150 police officers and civilians were honored at the City of Pittsburgh Bureau of Police Inaugural Years of Service Recognition Ceremony Dec. 12 at Point Park University.Â Alumni Profile Brittany Bishop '17 Meet sports, arts and entertainment management alumna Brittany Bishop, marketing assistant for Live Nation Pittsburgh and live social contributor for the National Hockey League. Alumni Profile Hillary Maglin '15 As an editorial intern at Rachael Ray Every Day magazine, Hillary Maglin is gaining hands-on experience writing, covering events and posting to the magazine's social media channels. Alumni Profile Brianna Damich '17 Meet Brianna Damich, 2017 Master of Science in health care administration and management alumna and Midwest Region U500 Dental Sales Manager for Cigna. Alumni Profile Andrew Gall '07 Meet criminal justice alumnus Andrew Gall, chief of detectives for Beaver County District Attorneyâs Office. Alumni Profile Bryan Turner '18 Meet MBA alumnus Bryan Turner, corporate actions accounting supervisor and BNY Mellon's 2018 Asset Servicing Employee of the Year. Alumni Profile Jean Keene '12 Meet Jean Keene, a Master of Science in environmental studies graduate and environmental education specialist for Keystone State Park. Alumni Profile Jessica Joseph '17 \"Get an internship as soon as possible. You can sit in a classroom and learn all about how to use certain tools to help you create something meaningful, but nothing compares to experience. Internships give you an inside look into your desired field without working full time.\" Alumni Profile Samantha Crowe '14 Meet Samantha Crowe, a 2014 sports, arts and entertainment management alumna and marketing specialist for Comcast Technology Solutions in Colorado. Alumni Profile Sergio Flores '10 '18 Meet IT and MBA international alumnus Sergio Flores, a system integration technician for Bombardier Transportation. Alumni Profile Alexis Sherman '18 Meet Alexis Sherman, a legal studies and political science alumna who was hired as a paralegal for Kraemer, Manes & Associates. Alumni Profile Perris Drew '16 2016 theatre alumnus Perris Drew highlights his career as a professional actor and offers career advice to Point Park students. Alumni Profile Kenya Matthews '14 Meet Kenya Matthews, an information technology graduate of Point Park University and AVP for PNC, who was named to the New Pittsburgh Courier's Fab 40 Class of 2018. IT Alumnus, MBA Student One of 28 Veterans Across the Nation Selected for Google Summit Tuesday, November 13, 2018 Point Park University information technology alumnus and MBA student Jaime Ballesteros '18 was one of only 28 student veterans across the nation selected to attend the 2018 Google Student Veteran SummitÂ in Los Angeles. Alumni Profile Jessica Merritt '16 Meet Jessica Merritt, a Rowland School of Business alumna and customer success manager for Othot. Alumni Profile Faith Kraynik '17 \"My Point Park experience taught me how important collaboration and communication are to a creative production.\" Alumni Profile Kevin Dotson '16 Meet Kevin Dotson, human resource management alumnus and physician employment coordinator for UPMC. Alumni Profile Michele Tabaka '13 \"As a part of the advertising team at The Washington Post, I work closely with advertising agencies and marketing managers to analyze marketing needs and recommend appropriate advertising solutions per each clientâs budget,\" Tabaka said. Point Park University-Produced Film Premiers on WQED Thursday, October 11, 2018 Pennsylvaniaâs endangered watersheds are the focus of Downstream, a half-hour documentary produced by Point Park University's School of Communication environmental journalism program, in association with WQED Multimedia, and made possible through a grant from the Heinz Endowments. Alumni Profile Hana Rydl '15 '16 Meet Hana Rydl, a B.S. in biological sciences and an M.