tories. From Point Park University to Havas PR: Alumni Work for One of the World's Largest Communications Groups Thursday, May 24, 2018 Alumni Stacey Simon and Kariann Mano discuss their careers at Havas PR Pittsburgh and how their Point Park University experience prepared them for their roles. Alumni Profile Alumni Profile: Meet Stacey Simon, Account Supervisor, Havas PR Pittsburgh \"Having now experienced a range of industries and roles in the communications field, I can genuinely say that Iâm still thankful for my Point Park education to this day,\" she said. Alumni Profile Alumni Profile: Meet Kariann Mano, Assistant Account Executive, Havas PR Pittsburgh \"As an assistant account executive, I am responsible for creating content for social media, blog posts and newsletters, reviewing content for educational resources, media outreach to key trades and occasionally national media, and coordinate with vendors for trade show participation,\" she said. Alumni Profile Guillermo Velazquez '18 Meet 2018 MBA graduate Guillermo Velazquez, executive director of the Pittsburgh Hispanic Development Corporation. Alumni Profile Alethia Bush '11 Meet criminal justice administration alumna Alethia Bush, founder of The Center for Successful Reentry and case manager for the A. Philip Randolph Institute. Alumni Profile Adam Rivers '18 Meet Adam Rivers, a 2018 graduate of the M.S. in health care administration and management program. Alumni Profile Robyn Roux '12 Meet Robyn Roux, a 2012 global cultural studies graduate working as a Kindergarten ESL teacher in Hanoi, Vietnam. Alumni Profile Jose Flores '18 Meet Jose Flores, a 2018 information technology alumnus, M.B.A. student, veteran and Enterprise Architecture and Optimization Student Employee for U.S. Steel Corporation. Alumni Profile Erika Mangual '16 Meet Erika Mangual '16, a business management alumna and embedded control analyst for The Bank of New York Mellon. Global Cultural Studies and Dance Graduate Presents Research at